<% /* step: 1 = Cart, 2 = Checkout, 3 = Done.
     A8 animated stepper (feat/animations-delight): uporer soru
     progress bar-ta step onujayi vore — 1 = 0%, 2 = 50%, 3 = 100%.
     Fill-er width inline --step-progress variable-e; CSS
     @keyframes checkout-fill 0 theke oi width porjonto animate kore
     (base width-i final width, tai prefers-reduced-motion-e
     animation bondho holeo bar thik jaygay thake). Step pill gulo
     ager motoi (active sonali, done sobuj) — bodlano hoy ni. */ %>
<% const _stepPct = step >= 3 ? 100 : (step >= 2 ? 50 : 0); %>
<div class="checkout-steps-progress" aria-hidden="true"><span class="checkout-steps-fill" style="--step-progress: <%= _stepPct %>%"></span></div>
<div class="checkout-steps">
  <span class="<%= step >= 1 ? 'active' : '' %> <%= step > 1 ? 'done' : '' %>">1. Cart</span>
  <span class="step-arrow">→</span>
  <span class="<%= step >= 2 ? 'active' : '' %> <%= step > 2 ? 'done' : '' %>">2. Checkout</span>
  <span class="step-arrow">→</span>
  <span class="<%= step >= 3 ? 'active' : '' %>">3. Done</span>
</div>
